# Genetic algorithms for the numerical solution of variational problems without analytic trial functions

**Authors:** Carlos D. Toledo

## Summary
A coding of functions that allows a genetic algorithm to minimize functionals without analytic trial functions is presented and implemented for solving numerically some instances of variational problems from physics.


